function renderPlaces(){let q=($('placeQ')?.value||'').toLowerCase(),cat=$('placeCat')?.value||'',st=$('placeStatus')?.value||'',dl=$('placeDeadline')?.value||'',sort=$('placeSort')?.value||'registered';let arr=data.places.filter(p=>{let its=data.items.filter(i=>i.placeId===p.id);let hay=[p.name,p.address,p.city,p.area,p.genre,p.note,p.stationName,...(p.lines||[]),...(p.tags||[]),...its.map(i=>i.name),...its.map(i=>i.note),...(p.urls||[]).flatMap(u=>[u.label,u.url]),p.tripId].join(' ').toLowerCase();return(!q||hay.includes(q))&&(!cat||p.category===cat)&&(!st||p.status===st)&&deadlineMatch(p.deadline,dl)&&(!selectedTags.length||selectedTags.every(tag=>(p.tags||[]).includes(tag)))});let text=v=>String(v||'').trim();let cmp=(a,b)=>text(a).localeCompare(text(b),'ja',{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});if(sort==='name')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='address')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.address,b.address));else if(sort==='genre')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.genre,b.genre)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='line')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp((a.lines||[]).join(' / '),(b.lines||[]).join(' / '))||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='station')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.stationName,b.stationName)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='priority')arr.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.priority||0)-Number(a.priority||0)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='price')arr.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.price||0)-Number(a.price||0)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='visited')arr.sort((a,b)=>text(b.visitedAt).localeCompare(text(a.visitedAt))||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='deadline')arr.sort((a,b)=>{let ad=a.deadline||'9999-12-31',bd=b.deadline||'9999-12-31';return ad.localeCompare(bd)||cmp(a.name,b.name)});else if(sort==='distance'){if(window.userLocation)arr.sort((a,b)=>distM(window.userLocation.lat,window.userLocation.lng,a.lat,a.lng)-distM(window.userLocation.lat,window.userLocation.lng,b.lat,b.lng));else arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.name,b.name));}else arr.sort((a,b)=>String(b.id||'').localeCompare(String(a.id||'')));$('places').innerHTML=arr.length?arr.map(placeCard).join(''):'<div class="empty">条件に合う場所がありません。</div>'}

function renderItems(){let q=($('itemQ')?.value||'').toLowerCase(),t=$('itemType')?.value||'',st=$('itemStatus')?.value||'',fav=$('itemFavorite')?.value||'',dl=$('itemDeadline')?.value||'',sort=$('itemSort')?.value||'registered';let arr=data.items.filter(i=>{let p=data.places.find(p=>p.id===i.placeId);return(!q||[i.name,i.note,p?.name,p?.address,p?.genre,p?.stationName,...(p?.lines||[]),...(i.tags||[]),...(i.urls||[]).flatMap(u=>[u.label,u.url])].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!t||i.type===t)&&(!st||i.status===st)&&(!fav||!!i.favorite)&&deadlineMatch(i.deadline,dl)&&(!selectedItemTags.length||selectedItemTags.every(tag=>(i.tags||[]).includes(tag)))});let text=v=>String(v||'').trim();let cmp=(a,b)=>text(a).localeCompare(text(b),'ja',{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});if(sort==='name')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(a.name,b.name)||cmp(a.id,b.id));else if(sort==='type')arr.sort((a,b)=>cmp(({buy:'買いたい',eat:'食べたい',do:'やりたい'})[a.type],({buy:'買いたい',eat:'食べたい',do:'やりたい'})[b.type])||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='place')arr.sort((a,b)=>{let pa=data.places.find(p=>p.id===a.placeId),pb=data.places.find(p=>p.id===b.placeId);return cmp(pa?.name,pb?.name)||cmp(a.name,b.name)});else if(sort==='priceAsc')arr.sort((a,b)=>Number(a.price||0)-Number(b.price||0)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='priceDesc')arr.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.price||0)-Number(a.price||0)||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='status')arr.sort((a,b)=>Number(a.status==='done')-Number(b.status==='done')||cmp(a.name,b.name));else if(sort==='deadline')arr.sort((a,b)=>(a.deadline||'9999-12-31').localeCompare(b.deadline||'9999-12-31')||cmp(a.name,b.name));else arr.sort((a,b)=>String(b.id||'').localeCompare(String(a.id||'')));$('items').innerHTML=arr.length?arr.map(i=>{let p=data.places.find(p=>p.id===i.placeId);return `<div class="card"><div class="item"><div class="item-main"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px"><button class="favorite-btn ${i.favorite?'active':''}" title="お気に入り" onclick="toggleItemFavorite('${i.id}')">${i.favorite?'★':'☆'}</button><div class="item-name"><span class="type-badge">${i.type==='buy'?'買いたい':i.type==='eat'?'食べたい':'やりたい'}</span>${esc(i.name)}</div></div><div class="item-meta">${p?`<button type="button" class="linked-place" onclick="openPlace('${p.id}')">${esc(p.name)}</button>`:'場所未設定'} ${i.price?'・ '+yen(i.price):''}</div>${!p?`<button class="btn small" onclick="openItem('${i.id}')">場所を追加</button>`:''}${deadlineHtml(i.deadline)}${(i.tags||[]).length?`<div class="chips">${i.tags.map(t=>`<span class="chip tag-chip">#${esc(t)}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="chips"><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" ${i.status==='done'?'checked':''} onchange="toggleItemDone('${i.id}',this.checked)"><span>${i.status==='done'?'済み':'未完了'}</span></label>${i.note?`<span class="chip">${esc(i.note)}</span>`:''}</div></div>${urlHtml(i.urls)}${i.photo?`<img class="thumb" src="${i.photo}">`:''}<button class="btn" onclick="openItem('${i.id}')">編集</button><button class="btn danger" onclick="delItem('${i.id}')">削除</button></div></div>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">条件に合うものがありません。</div>';let want=data.items.filter(i=>i.status!=='done').length,done=data.items.filter(i=>i.status==='done').length,total=data.items.reduce((s,i)=>s+Number(i.price||0),0);$('stats').innerHTML=`<div class="stat"><b>${want}</b><span>未完了</span></div><div class="stat"><b>${done}</b><span>済み</span></div><div class="stat"><b>${yen(total)}</b><span>登録価格合計</span></div>`}

function getTripPlaceIds(tripId){return data.places.filter(p=>{let ids=Array.isArray(p.tripIds)?p.tripIds:[];return ids.includes(tripId)||(p.tripId===tripId&&!ids.includes(tripId))}).map(p=>p.id)}
function getTripOrderedPlaces(tripId){let t=trips.find(x=>x.id===tripId),ids=getTripPlaceIds(tripId),by=new Map(ids.map(id=>[id,data.places.find(p=>p.id===id)]));let order=Array.isArray(t?.placeOrder)?t.placeOrder:[];let seen=new Set();let arr=[];order.forEach(id=>{if(by.has(id)){arr.push(by.get(id));seen.add(id)}});ids.forEach(id=>{if(!seen.has(id)&&by.has(id))arr.push(by.get(id))});return arr}
function moveTripPlace(tripId,placeId,dir){let t=trips.find(x=>x.id===tripId);if(!t)return;let arr=getTripOrderedPlaces(tripId).map(p=>p.id),i=arr.indexOf(placeId),j=i+dir;if(i<0||j<0||j>=arr.length)return;[arr[i],arr[j]]=[arr[j],arr[i]];t.placeOrder=arr;persistTrips();openTripDetail(tripId)}
function renderTrips(){let sort=$('tripSort')?.value||'nearest';let arr=[...trips];let dateVal=t=>String(t.startDate||t.date||'');let registered=(t)=>String(t.id||'');let today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);let cmpName=(a,b)=>String(a.name||'').localeCompare(String(b.name||''),'ja',{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});if(sort==='nearest'){arr.sort((a,b)=>{let ad=dateVal(a),bd=dateVal(b);let af=ad&&ad>=today,bf=bd&&bd>=today;if(af!==bf)return af?-1:1;if(af&&bf)return ad.localeCompare(bd)||cmpName(a,b);if(ad&&bd)return bd.localeCompare(ad)||cmpName(a,b);if(ad)return -1;if(bd)return 1;return registered(b).localeCompare(registered(a))||cmpName(a,b)})}else if(sort==='startAsc'){arr.sort((a,b)=>{let ad=dateVal(a)||'9999-12-31',bd=dateVal(b)||'9999-12-31';return ad.localeCompare(bd)||cmpName(a,b)})}else if(sort==='startDesc'){arr.sort((a,b)=>{let ad=dateVal(a)||'0000-01-01',bd=dateVal(b)||'0000-01-01';return bd.localeCompare(ad)||cmpName(a,b)})}else{arr.sort((a,b)=>registered(b).localeCompare(registered(a)))}$('trips').innerHTML=arr.length?arr.map(t=>{let ps=getTripPlaceIds(t.id);let type=t.type==='outing'?'お出かけ':t.type==='trip'?'旅行':'';let start=t.startDate||t.date||'',end=t.endDate||start;let dateText=start?(t.dateMode==='range'&&end&&end!==start?`${esc(start)}〜${esc(end)}`:esc(start)):'';let completedBadge=t.completed?'<span class="chip" style="margin-left:6px">完了</span>':'';return `<div class="card trip-card" onclick="openTripDetail('${t.id}')" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="trip-info"><div class="trip-name"><span class="category-icon"><span class="ico ico-plane"></span>${esc(t.name)}${completedBadge}</span></div><div class="meta">${type?esc(type)+(dateText?' ・ ':''):''}${dateText}${ps.length?' ・ '+ps.length+'か所':''}</div></div><button class="btn" onclick="event.stopPropagation();openTrip('${t.id}')">編集</button><button class="btn danger" onclick="event.stopPropagation();delTrip('${t.id}')">削除</button></div>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">まだ旅行・お出かけがありません。</div>';if($('tripSort'))$('tripSort').onchange=renderTrips}
function tripNumberIcon(n){return L.divIcon({className:'',html:`<div class="trip-map-pin">${n}</div>`,iconSize:[30,30],iconAnchor:[15,15],popupAnchor:[0,-18]})}
function renderTripDetailMap(places){if(!places.length||!$('tripDetailMap'))return;tripDetailMap=L.map('tripDetailMap').setView([35.6812,139.7671],11);L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',{maxZoom:19,attribution:'© OpenStreetMap contributors'}).addTo(tripDetailMap);let bounds=[];places.forEach((p,i)=>{if(p.anywhere||!p.lat||!p.lng)return;let n=i+1,m=L.marker([p.lat,p.lng],{icon:tripNumberIcon(n)}).addTo(tripDetailMap).bindPopup(`<b>${n}. ${esc(p.name)}</b><br>${esc(displayStoredAddress(p)||'')}`);tripDetailMarkers.push(m);bounds.push([p.lat,p.lng])});if(bounds.length){tripDetailMap.fitBounds(L.latLngBounds(bounds).pad(.2))}else{tripDetailMap.setView([35.6812,139.7671],5)}setTimeout(()=>tripDetailMap?.invalidateSize(),100)}

function tripDayCount(t){let a=t.startDate||t.date||'',b=t.endDate||a;if(!a)return 1;let x=new Date(a+'T00:00:00'),y=new Date(b+'T00:00:00');return Math.max(1,Math.floor((y-x)/86400000)+1)}
function dayLabel(t,d){let a=t.startDate||t.date||'';if(!a)return d+'日目';let x=new Date(a+'T00:00:00');x.setDate(x.getDate()+d-1);return d+'日目（'+x.toLocaleDateString('ja-JP',{month:'numeric',day:'numeric'})+'）'}
function getDayPlan(t,d){
 t.dayPlans=t.dayPlans||{};let old=t.dayPlans[String(d)]||{};
 if(d===1){
  if(!old.startPoint&&t.startPoint)old.startPoint=t.startPoint;
  if(!old.endPoint&&t.endPoint)old.endPoint=t.endPoint;
  if(!old.startTime&&t.startTime)old.startTime=t.startTime;
  if(!old.endTime&&t.endTime)old.endTime=t.endTime;
 }else if(old.startFromPreviousGoal){
  const prev=t.dayPlans[String(d-1)];
  const prevGoal=prev?.endPoint||null;
  if(prevGoal)old.startPoint=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(prevGoal));
 }
 return old
}
function pointText(pt){return pt?(pt.name||pt.address||'地点'):'未設定'}
function pointCoords(pt){return pt&&Number.isFinite(Number(pt.lat))&&Number.isFinite(Number(pt.lng))?[Number(pt.lat),Number(pt.lng)]:null}
function durationLabel(v){if(v===undefined||v===null||v===''||v==='auto')return '自動';let n=Math.max(0,Math.round(Number(v)));if(!Number.isFinite(n))return '自動';let h=Math.floor(n/60),m=n%60;return h?(h+'時間'+(m?m+'分':'')):n+'分'}
function getDuration(t,p){let d=(t.placeDurations||{})[p.id];return d===undefined?'auto':d}
function getPlaceDay(t,p){let d=(t.placeDays||{})[p.id];return Math.max(1,Number(d||1))}
function setPlaceDay(tripId,placeId,v){let t=trips.find(x=>x.id===tripId);if(!t)return;t.placeDays=t.placeDays||{};t.placeDays[placeId]=Math.max(1,Number(v)||1);persistTrips();openTripPlan(tripId)}
function setPlaceDuration(tripId,placeId,v){let t=trips.find(x=>x.id===tripId);if(!t)return;t.placeDurations=t.placeDurations||{};t.placeDurations[placeId]=v;persistTrips();openTripPlan(tripId)}
function travelKey(d,from,to){return String(d)+'|'+String(from||'start')+'>'+String(to||'end')}
function getTravelSetting(t,d,from,to){return (t.travelSettings||{})[travelKey(d,from,to)]||null}
